# Database Schema

Ref: `supabase/migrations/20250222000000_initial_schema.sql`, `supabase/migrations/20250222000001_storage_documents.sql`

**Tabelas:**

- **resumes** — id, user_id, parsed_data (JSONB → ResumeData), created_at, updated_at.
- **analyses** — id, user_id, resume_id, job_snapshot (JSONB → jobSnapshotSchema), score (0–100), optimized_score (0–100, opcional), matched_skills_count (≥0), user_hard_skills (JSONB array), user_soft_skills (JSONB array), missing_hard_skills (JSONB array), missing_soft_skills (JSONB array), status (pending|completed|abandoned), optimized_resume_data (JSONB, opcional; preenchido ao concluir o passo de melhorar currículo em generateResumePreview; usado na geração do documento otimizado no download), created_at.
- **user_credits** — user_id (PK), credits (≥0, default 3), updated_at.
- **purchases** — id, stripe_session_id (UNIQUE), user_id, package_id, credits_granted (>0), created_at. Sem policies RLS; só service client (webhook).
- **optimized_documents** — id, analysis_id, file_path, format (pdf|docx), created_at.

**Mapping:** parsed_data → resumeDataSchema; job_snapshot → jobSnapshotSchema; user_hard_skills/user_soft_skills = skills matched; missing_hard_skills/missing_soft_skills = skills faltantes; status atualizado em runSkillsMatch e generateResumePreview.

**RLS:** resumes, analyses, user_credits = auth.uid()=user_id. user_credits usa WITH CHECK. optimized_documents = SELECT/INSERT/DELETE via análise (EXISTS analysis do user). purchases = RLS ativado mas sem policies (apenas service role).

**Storage:** bucket `documents` para PDF/DOCX; políticas em `20250222000001_storage_documents.sql`: INSERT, SELECT e DELETE quando `(storage.foldername(name))[1] = auth.uid()::text` (path `{user_id}/*`).
